  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      77.76,
      398.95,
      286.44,
      409.04
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: RPDS/LND/09/ACQ/05/05/09.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      410.47,
      286.44,
      494.69
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of section (7) of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the Following lands which are required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      496.15,
      286.46,
      604.4
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: Following allotments of land depicted as Lot No. 1 in extent 0.3729 Hectare in Plan No. R. 313 made by Surveor General, situated in Ratnapura (Division No. 3 Veralupa, within Ratnapura Municipal Council area) Village of 152 B Veralupa Grama Niladhari Division of Uda Paththuwa sub Division in Kuruwita Koralaya, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Rathnapura in the District of Rathnapura in Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      605.84,
      286.41,
      653.11
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 01 Name of Land:Diwulgaha Kumbura, Mulwakkada, Godakele; Description: Open bare land; Claimant:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.16,
      539.37,
      379.28
    ],
    "text": "Government; First Claimant: H. M. Shelton Premathilaka and Jayalal Premasinha, Demuwawatha, Rathnapura; Extent: 0.3729 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      380.72,
      539.38,
      448.16
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the 10.00 a.m. on 25th day of November 2016 at Rathnapura Divisonal Secretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      449.6,
      539.39,
      528.8
    ],
    "text": "Moreover, they are hereby requested to notify to me in writing with two duplicates on or before the 18th day of November, 2016 the nature of their interest in land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      530.91,
      540.6,
      652.88
    ],
